Step 1: Loading the Data (Sample data: Refer Test_Data.png)

import pandas as pd
df = pd.read_csv('sales_data.csv')


Step 2: Data Cleaning and Filtering

df_filtered = df[df['Sales']>100]

O/P: Refer Data_cleaning.png


Step 3: Grouping and Aggregation

category_sales = df_filtered.groupby('Category')['Sales'].sum()
print(category_sales)

O/P:
Category Sales
Apparel         1200.00
Electronics     850.00


Step 4: Data Visualization

import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

df = pd.read_csv('sales_data.csv')
category_sales = df.groupby('Category')['Sales'].sum()
category_sales.plot(kind='bar')
plt.show()

O/P: Refer to Data_visualization.png




